<body class="wp-singular page-template page-template-elementor_canvas page page-id-160 wp-embed-responsive wp-theme-twentytwentyfive elementor-default elementor-template-canvas elementor-kit-4 elementor-page elementor-page-160">
			<div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="160" class="elementor elementor-160">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00000 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="e00000" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default">
					<style id="exjsx-raw-u4vhzd-0">.elementor-element-e00000{margin:0 !important;height:0;line-height:0;}.elementor .e-u4vhzd-e00005-s.e-u4vhzd-e00005-s{text-transform:uppercase;}.elementor .e-u4vhzd-e0000p-s.e-u4vhzd-e0000p-s{text-transform:uppercase;}.elementor .e-u4vhzd-e00018-s.e-u4vhzd-e00018-s{text-transform:uppercase;}.elementor .e-u4vhzd-e0001v-s.e-u4vhzd-e0001v-s{text-transform:uppercase;}.elementor .e-u4vhzd-e00026-s.e-u4vhzd-e00026-s{text-transform:uppercase;}.elementor .e-u4vhzd-e0002q-s.e-u4vhzd-e0002q-s{text-transform:uppercase;}.elementor .e-u4vhzd-e00031-s.e-u4vhzd-e00031-s{text-transform:uppercase;}</style>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00001 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e00001-s " data-id="e00001" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00001">
    <section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00002 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e00002-s " data-id="e00002" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00002">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00003 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-u4vhzd-e00003-s " data-id="e00003" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00003">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00004 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e00004-s " data-id="e00004" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00004">
    			<p class="e-u4vhzd-e00005-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00005">Moss Hollow · a small game</p>
					<h1 data-interaction-id="e00006" class="e-u4vhzd-e00006-s e-heading-base">No timers. No ads. No shop. £6.99 once.</h1>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e00007-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00007">Moss Hollow is a small farming and foraging game about a valley that keeps going whether you show up or not. Play for ten minutes or two hours. Nothing wilts because you were busy.</p>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e00008-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00008"><a href="#buy" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Buy Moss Hollow
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00009 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e00009-s " data-id="e00009" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00009">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0000a-s " data-id="e0000a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000a">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000b" class="e-u4vhzd-e0000b-s e-heading-base">No ads</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0000c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000c">Never any. Not between days, not for a bigger barn.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0000d-s " data-id="e0000d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000d">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000e" class="e-u4vhzd-e0000e-s e-heading-base">No timers</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0000f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000f">No energy, no waiting, no crops rotting overnight.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0000g-s " data-id="e0000g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000g">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000h" class="e-u4vhzd-e0000h-s e-heading-base">No shop</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0000i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000i">Nothing is locked behind a second payment.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0000j-s " data-id="e0000j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000j">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000k" class="e-u4vhzd-e0000k-s e-heading-base">£6.99 once</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0000l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000l">One price, every device you own, forever.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0000m-s " data-id="e0000m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000m">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000n e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-u4vhzd-e0000n-s " data-id="e0000n" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0000n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0000o-s " data-id="e0000o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000o">
    			<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0000p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000p">Ten minutes a day</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0000q" class="e-u4vhzd-e0000q-s e-heading-base">What you actually do</h2>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0000r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000r">Forage the woods, trade with six neighbours who remember what you gave them, plant what the season allows, and slowly work out why the old mill stopped.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000s e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-u4vhzd-e0000s-s " data-id="e0000s" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0000s">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0000t-s " data-id="e0000t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000t">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000u" class="e-u4vhzd-e0000u-s e-heading-base">Forage</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0000v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000v">Baskets of chanterelles, sloes, wet bark and things you cannot identify yet.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0000w-s " data-id="e0000w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000w">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000x" class="e-u4vhzd-e0000x-s e-heading-base">Trade</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0000y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000y">Six neighbours, each with a long memory for kindness and for jam.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0000z-s " data-id="e0000z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000z">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00010" class="e-u4vhzd-e00010-s e-heading-base">Plant</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e00011-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00011">Whatever the season allows, at whatever pace suits the week you are having.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00012 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e00012-s " data-id="e00012" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00012">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00013" class="e-u4vhzd-e00013-s e-heading-base">Wonder</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e00014-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00014">About the old mill, which stopped a long time before you arrived.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00015 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e00015-s " data-id="e00015" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00015">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00016 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-u4vhzd-e00016-s " data-id="e00016" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00016">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00017 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e00017-s " data-id="e00017" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00017">
    			<p class="e-u4vhzd-e00018-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00018">About 28 real days each</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00019" class="e-u4vhzd-e00019-s e-heading-base">The seasons, and what changes</h2>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0001a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001a">Four seasons of about 28 real days each. Spring is mushrooms and mud. Summer is the fair. Autumn is the best month and everyone says so. Winter is quiet and a little sad on purpose.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0001b-s " data-id="e0001b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001b">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0001c-s " data-id="e0001c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001c">
    			<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0001d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001d">Season one</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001e" class="e-u4vhzd-e0001e-s e-heading-base">Spring</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0001f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001f">Mushrooms and mud, and a valley that smells like rain on stone.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0001g-s " data-id="e0001g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001g">
    			<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0001h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001h">Season two</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001i" class="e-u4vhzd-e0001i-s e-heading-base">Summer</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0001j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001j">The fair. Bunting, a competition you can lose gracefully, long light.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0001k-s " data-id="e0001k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001k">
    			<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0001l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001l">Season three</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001m" class="e-u4vhzd-e0001m-s e-heading-base">Autumn</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0001n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001n">The best month and everyone says so. Everything at once, gold everywhere.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0001o-s " data-id="e0001o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001o">
    			<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0001p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001p">Season four</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001q" class="e-u4vhzd-e0001q-s e-heading-base">Winter</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0001r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001r">Quiet, and a little sad on purpose. The mill sits under snow and waits.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0001s-s " data-id="e0001s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001s">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001t e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-u4vhzd-e0001t-s " data-id="e0001t" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0001t">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0001u-s " data-id="e0001u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001u">
    			<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0001v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001v">Offline, on a plane, in a tunnel</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0001w" class="e-u4vhzd-e0001w-s e-heading-base">It works with the aeroplane mode on</h2>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0001x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001x">Fully offline. No account, no login, no server. It works on a plane and it will still work in nine years when we have moved on to something else.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0001y-s " data-id="e0001y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001y">
    			<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0001z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001z">No account</p>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e00020-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00020">No login</p>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e00021-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00021">No server</p>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e00022-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00022">Nothing to go down</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00023 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e00023-s " data-id="e00023" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00023">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00024 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-u4vhzd-e00024-s " data-id="e00024" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00024">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00025 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e00025-s " data-id="e00025" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00025">
    			<p class="e-u4vhzd-e00026-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00026">Playable how you play</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00027" class="e-u4vhzd-e00027-s e-heading-base">Accessibility, decided early</h2>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e00028-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00028">One-handed portrait play, full colourblind palettes, adjustable text size up to 200 percent, and no reflex or timing challenge anywhere in the game.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00029 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-u4vhzd-e00029-s " data-id="e00029" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00029">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0002a-s " data-id="e0002a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002a">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002b" class="e-u4vhzd-e0002b-s e-heading-base">One hand, portrait</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0002c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002c">Every action sits inside the reach of one thumb.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0002d-s " data-id="e0002d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002d">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002e" class="e-u4vhzd-e0002e-s e-heading-base">Colourblind palettes</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0002f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002f">Full alternate palettes, not a filter bolted on at the end.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0002g-s " data-id="e0002g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002g">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002h" class="e-u4vhzd-e0002h-s e-heading-base">Text up to 200%</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0002i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002i">The interface reflows properly at every step of the scale.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0002j-s " data-id="e0002j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002j">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002k" class="e-u4vhzd-e0002k-s e-heading-base">No reflex tests</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0002l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002l">No timing challenge anywhere. Nothing you can be too slow for.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0002m-s " data-id="e0002m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002m">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002n e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-u4vhzd-e0002n-s " data-id="e0002n" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0002n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0002o-s " data-id="e0002o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002o">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0002p-s " data-id="e0002p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002p">
    			<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0002q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002q">38 minutes, written by Ida Brann</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0002r" class="e-u4vhzd-e0002r-s e-heading-base">Piano, clarinet and field recordings</h2>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0002s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002s">38 minutes of original music for piano, clarinet and field recordings, written by Ida Brann, included free as a download with the game.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0002t-s " data-id="e0002t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002t">
    			<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0002u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002u">Piano</p>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0002v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002v">Clarinet</p>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0002w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002w">Field recordings</p>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0002x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002x">Free download</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0002y-s " data-id="e0002y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002z e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-u4vhzd-e0002z-s " data-id="e0002z" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0002z">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00030 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e00030-s " data-id="e00030" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00030">
    			<p class="e-u4vhzd-e00031-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00031">One price</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00032" class="e-u4vhzd-e00032-s e-heading-base">£6.99</h2>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e00033-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00033">Paid once, at the door, and then never again.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00034 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e00034-s " data-id="e00034" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00034">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00035" class="e-u4vhzd-e00035-s e-heading-base">iOS and Android</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e00036-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00036">£6.99 on iOS and Android, family sharing enabled, one purchase covers every device you own.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00037 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e00037-s " data-id="e00037" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00037">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00038" class="e-u4vhzd-e00038-s e-heading-base">Family sharing</h3>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e00039-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00039">There is no second thing to buy because we did not make one. No currency, no season pass, no barn upgrade.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0003a-s " data-id="e0003a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003a" id="buy">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-u4vhzd-e0003b-s " data-id="e0003b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003b">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0003c" class="e-u4vhzd-e0003c-s e-heading-base">Buy once. That is the whole arrangement.</h2>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0003d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003d">£6.99, one purchase, every device you own. The valley keeps going whether you show up or not — and it will still be there in nine years.</p>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0003e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003e"><a href="#buy" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Buy Moss Hollow
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-u4vhzd-e0003f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003f">No account · no ads · no purchases · works offline</p>
		
</div>

</section>

</div>
